%% Target design only. Authentication and authorization excluded.
flowchart TD
    A[Swagger / 클라이언트] --> B[FastAPI: DTO · 요청별 context · DI]
    B --> C[validate_request_context]
    C --> D[check_session_risk]
    D --> E[check_input_policy]
    E --> F[mask_personal_data: 저장·전송 전]
